WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:04.640
Life Hack: a gun-free America in 5 easy steps.

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:08.480
For a gun-free America, the first thing you'll
need is two-thirds of Congress.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:13.880
So elect a minimum of 67 Senators and 290
Representatives who are on your side.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.940
Then, have them vote to propose an amendment
to the Constitution

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:20.840
which repeals Second Amendment gun rights
for all Americans.

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:25.460
Then convince the legislators of 38 states
to ratify that amendment.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:29.380
Congratulations, the Second Amendment is now
history!

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:32.960
At this point you've done nothing to decrease
gun violence.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:36.780
All you've done is remove the barrier for
Congress to legally act.

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:40.420
You need to enact "common sense" 
gun reform.

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:45.340
You can try to do what Australia did and...ban
all guns?

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:47.020
That's not at all what they did,

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:48.340
but whatever, fuck it.

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:49.660
Go big or go home, right?

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:53.820
Get that law passed by Congress and signed
by the president.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:54.460
Great!

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:57.240
The law is passed and guns are now illegal.

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:58.640
The only thing left to do is...

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:00.140
Enforce the law.

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:02.240
Guns don't just disappear because you passed
a law.

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:09.740
You need to confiscate some 350 million guns
scattered among over 330 Million Americans.

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:12.020
Sure, you can try a buy-back program like
Australia,

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:13.960
but like Australia that will still leave behind

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:17.920
anywhere from 60 percent to 80 percent of
privately owned firearms.

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:20.720
The rest of them you have to take.

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:25.680
You'll need the police, the FBI, the ATF,
the National Guard—

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:30.160
all known for their nuanced approach to potentially
dangerous situations—

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:38.620
to go door-to-door, through 3.8 million square
miles of this country and take them, by force,

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:43.460
from thousands, if not, millions of well-armed
individuals.

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:48.030
Many of whom would rather start a civil war
than acquiesce.

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:55.220
So inevitably gun violence, which is currently
at a historic low, will skyrocket.

00:01:57.020 --> 00:02:02.100
But that is how you get a gun-free America
in five easy steps.

